客户端名与超时配置的键都是 resource-lock。锁定服务认同一把键，并在自己的库提交：

```java
@Transactional
public LockResult reserve(String idemKey, ReserveRequest req) {
  LockResult seen = idempotency.find(idemKey);
  if (seen != null) return seen;
  int updated = stock.reserveIfEnough(req.skuId(), req.qty());
  LockResult result = updated == 1 ? LockResult.RESERVED : LockResult.REJECTED;
  idempotency.save(idemKey, req.orderId(), result);
  return result;
}
```

支付库的两行一次提交。中继在这次提交外面，先发送再改状态：

```java
@Transactional
public void markPaid(String paymentId, String orderId) {
  int updated = payment.markPaid(paymentId);
  if (updated == 1) outbox.insert(paymentId, "PaymentPaid", orderId, "NEW");
}

@Scheduled(fixedDelay = 1000)
public void publish() {
  for (OutboxRow row : outbox.findNew(50)) {
    broker.send(row.type(), row.payload());
    outbox.markSent(row.id());
  }
}
```

消费和签收都带原来的状态。支付失败是新的写入：

```java
@Transactional
public void onPaid(String paymentId, String orderId) {
  orders.markPaidIfPending(orderId, paymentId);
}

@Transactional
public void onReceived(String orderId) {
  orders.markCompletedIfShipped(orderId);
}

public void onPayFailed(String orderId) {
  locks.release(orderId);
  orders.markCancelledIfPending(orderId);
}
```

