创建返回后查三个库。支付方法返回后先只查支付库。同一支付单号再投一次，上面第一条更新影响 0 行：

```sql
SELECT status FROM orders WHERE id = ?;
SELECT reserved, idem_key FROM stock_lock WHERE order_id = ?;
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM payment WHERE order_id = ?;
SELECT status FROM outbox WHERE id = ?;
```
